  /* Below ~760 the clause no longer fits on one line inside the shell, and
     the width at which it stops fitting is a knife edge — measured, it flips
     between 455 and 465px. Cap the measure well clear of that so the break
     is always the same two balanced lines rather than a coin toss on the
